    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>This feature introduces dual stack networking in AKS using overlay networking, allowing nodes and pods to have both IPv4 and IPv6 addresses, enhancing connectivity and application compatibility.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/aks/azure-cni-overlay?tabs=kubectl%23dual-stack-networking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more.</a></p>\r\n",
